eria_medica","section":"female","label":"Female","startLine":12194,"endLine":12198,"text":"Great soreness in uterine region, with\nsympathetic palpitation of heart. Pain in sacro-iliac\njoints, running down leg. Itching at urinary meatus\nand vaginal orifice."},{"source":"04_boericke_materia_medica","section":"respiratory","label":"Respiratory","startLine":12199,"endLine":12201,"text":"Pulmonary congestion. Orthopnoea.\nDyspncea while walking. Hot feeling in throat."},{"source":"04_boericke_materia_medica","section":"heart","label":"Heart","startLine":12202,"endLine":12202,"text":"Feeling as if *heart beat throughout the"},{"source":"04_boericke_materia_medica","section":"chest","label":"chest","startLine":12203,"endLine":12216,"text":"Endocarditis, with extreme orthopnoea. Sensa-\ntion as if heart ceased beating, then starting very sud-\n\n272\n\n\ndenly. Palpitation from the least exertion. Tobacco\nheart, especially when due to cigarettes. Angina pec-\ntoris. Extremely rapid and irregular pulse.\n\nBack and Extremities. — Pain and aching in lum-\nbar region; aching of legs; in big toe. Trembling of\nhands. Aching in wrists and ankles."},{"source":"04_boericke_materia_medica","section":"fever","label":"Fever","startLine":12217,"endLine":12220,"text":"Chilly in back and down spine, followed by\nfever, little sweat. Thirst and headache during chill.\nDyspnoea during fever."},{"source":"04_boericke_materia_medica","section":"relationship","label":"Relationship","startLine":12221,"endLine":12224,"text":"Compare : Digit.; Cratceg. ; Lilmm ;\nAdonis (feeble heart action due only to functional dis-\nturbance)."},{"source":"04_boericke_materia_medica","section":"modalities","label":"Modalities","startLine":12225,"endLine":12227,"text":"Better, in open air. Worse, in warm\nroom."}],"corpusPassages":[]}